      "value": "3355",
      "description": "SEL-3355 / SEL-3355-2 Automation Controller base platform"
    },
    "note": "No per-digit Model Option Table is published in the available documentation. The SEL-3355-2 instruction manual (3355-2_IM_20260324_b.pdf) states under 'Models': \"Complete ordering information is not provided in this instruction manual. See the latest SEL-3355-2 Model Option Table at selinc.com.\" The 2026 and 2022 data sheets and instruction manuals contain only specifications (no ordering/part-number digit template), no SEL-3355 Model Option Table document exists in the ordering-information corpus (only accessory cable/module WIs), and no genuine SEL-3355 part number was found in any document or in the RDB uploads to calibrate positions. The unit is field-configurable (Intel Xeon E3-1505L/E3-1505M CPU, 8-64 GB RAM, up to four industrial SSD SATA drives with RAID, one or two SEL-9331 hot-swap power supplies, panel or rack mount, operating system, and up to four PCIe / one PCI expansion cards such as SEL-3390S8 / SEL-3390E4 / SEL-3390T), but the corresponding option-code digit positions are not obtainable from the on-hand sources, so no positions are asserted here. Drawing-layer anchors were intentionally not used per task scope.",
    "references": [
      "SEL-3355-2 Data Sheet (3355-2_DS_20260324.pdf)",
      "SEL-3355-2 Instruction Manual (3355-2_IM_20260324_b.pdf) - Models section defers ordering info to the online Model Option Table",
      "SEL-3355 Instruction Manual (3355_IM_20221221.pdf) - same deferral"
    ],
    "positions": []
